  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/829272/description_8efc8180-50e3-4376-b506-1f4629922f24.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"270\"></span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fdcchill\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/829272/description_36e68a7a-8da7-49a4-82f4-02400e7e54d2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"396\" height=\"80\"></span></a></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">感谢四百万次下载！</span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">传送器重制版（Create Teleporters Remastered）</h1><p><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>警告：使用新的重制版升级旧世界可能会导致自定义传送门出现问题。升级后，您的自定义传送门将被替换为占位方块。只需挖掘它即可获得新的自定义传送门基座。</strong></span></em></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d797\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qJhNtVP.png\" width=\"388\" height=\"136\"></a></p><h1><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">需要</span><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Create</span></h1><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">这是对原版《Create 传送器》模组的完全重制版。重新设计以更贴合 Create 模组的新美学风格，并且更易于使用。此重制版本修复了旧版错误并优化了机制。</span></p><h1><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">有哪些变化？<br></span></h1><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">不再需要传送接收器。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">移除了重力稳定器</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">宠物不会再随您一起传送。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">洞穴生成已修复。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">口袋维度不会再被覆盖。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">自定义传送门现为多方块结构。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">不同尺寸的实体传送器。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">不再需要 GeckoLib</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">简化了美学和模型。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">量子外壳的连接纹理</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">新的用户界面，与 Create 模组的风格一致。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">传送链接（非高级传送链接）现在有设定的范围，可在配置文件中调整</span></li>\n</ul><h1><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">实体传送器</span></span></h1><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1d4e2f05-2d4c-46ac-89d0-d19a5f04ecd3.png\"></span></p><h1><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">物品传送器</span></span></h1><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_21cea649-2396-4ada-bdec-37df61f6fc9f.png\" width=\"279\" height=\"297\"></span></p><h1><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">自定义传送门</span></span></h1><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">由自定义传送门基座和量子外壳构成的框架组成。</span></p><h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c56999ea-8ae6-40fd-9b37-1e4e6e0a15fa.png\" width=\"310\" height=\"310\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_73d9c7b6-8844-4ee4-95d1-c9b8d908ba72.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"285\"></span></p>",
